WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.057 --> 00:00:05.374
Big barracudas swam all around.

2
00:00:05.375 --> 00:00:10.108
Cora grabbed Mo and Lenny.

3
00:00:10.109 --> 00:00:13.213
They hid behind some seaweed.

4
00:00:13.214 --> 00:00:18.274
Two barracudas swam close to them.

5
00:00:18.275 --> 00:00:23.466
"I smell food," one barracuda said.

6
00:00:23.467 --> 00:00:29.967
"Good," the other one said. "I'm hungry!"

7
00:00:29.968 --> 00:00:32.751
Lenny gulped.

8
00:00:32.752 --> 00:00:36.779
"Shh," Cora said.

9
00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:40.773
The barracudas sniffed and looked around.

10
00:00:40.774 --> 00:00:45.693
"I guess our meal left," one said.

11
00:00:45.694 --> 00:00:49.424
"Ugh!" the other one said.

12
00:00:49.425 --> 00:00:59.685
They swam away.

13
00:00:59.686 --> 00:01:05.137
Cora started to swim out of the seaweed.

14
00:01:05.138 --> 00:01:10.120
But more barracudas were in front of them.

15
00:01:10.121 --> 00:01:14.248
"Don't move," Cora whispered.

16
00:01:14.249 --> 00:01:19.465
"Barracudas are everywhere!" Mo said.

17
00:01:19.466 --> 00:01:23.972
"How will we get home?" Lenny asked.

18
00:01:23.973 --> 00:01:28.053
"This is awful," Cora thought.

19
00:01:28.054 --> 00:01:33.537
The three of them waited and waited.

20
00:01:33.538 --> 00:01:39.812
Suddenly a barracuda stopped.

21
00:01:39.813 --> 00:01:42.893
"I see a fish we can eat!

22
00:01:42.894 --> 00:01:47.007
It's hiding in a clump of leaves!"

23
00:01:47.008 --> 00:01:50.602
All the barracudas hurried toward it.

24
00:01:50.603 --> 00:01:53.286
"Whew!" Mo said.

25
00:01:53.287 --> 00:01:56.201
"Now the barracudas will leave us alone."

26
00:01:56.202 --> 00:02:00.342
Lenny nodded. "Let's go home."

27
00:02:00.343 --> 00:02:08.737
Suddenly a barracuda laughed. "It's a clownfish!"

28
00:02:08.738 --> 00:02:12.642
"Uh-oh," Cora thought.

29
00:02:12.643 --> 00:02:17.124
She peeked at the clump of leaves.

30
00:02:17.125 --> 00:02:20.267
She gasped.

31
00:02:20.268 --> 00:02:26.238
The barracudas were swimming toward Sam!

